pair_coeff      2 2 0.5 0.88 2.2

neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep        0.005

thermo          50
thermo_style    custom step temp pe press etotal
thermo_modify   flush yes

velocity        all create 2.0 202610273 mom yes rot no dist gaussian

